WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,010
Suhao

2
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:03,550
The safety zones of several major coastal cities have begun to shift.

3
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,510
Electric signs are being used to tell everyone the evacuation route for survivors.

4
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:09,040
Go to the meeting point and wait for collection. Where to go?

5
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,440
The highlands to the north toward Sinai

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:13,080
Go south to Yungui area

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,680
Yungui plateau energy zone

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:19,140
Is there a basin? Why not do it?

9
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,620
The basin is surrounded by mountains

10
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:21,940
The altitude looks quite low

11
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,220
But once the white mist pours over the mountain pass and pours into the entire basin, it becomes a mouthful

12
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,180
pot filled with water

13
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:28,940
Don’t just look at altitude

14
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,700
You have to look around and you can’t even get around.

15
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:39,830
Get off the car and have lunch. Take a break to clear things up. Look at this.

16
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:43,310
Just like the batch yesterday, this is a loss

17
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,430
The direction of further evolution

18
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:46,310
Palm the black shell from the heart outward

19
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:50,310
The facial features slowly disappear, waiting for the shell to be filled with pistols

20
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:51,510
The submachine gun can't even be fired.

21
00:00:51,990 --> 00:00:53,470
Even self-awareness is gone

22
00:00:53,790 --> 00:00:54,950
No matter how powerful you evolve,

23
00:00:55,310 --> 00:00:56,310
What's the point?
